# Director's amendments (1) and (2)): the deny list (clippy.toml) the per-dependency review (DEPENDENCY-REVIEW.md)
# CONFIRMED for exactly this set; the features of the inventoried packages (a new one fails the gate until the shipped
# feature set that uses it is a `config`); the CONFIGURATIONS the gate checks (every shipped feature set of ioi-node:
# the default daemon build, the CI node profile of .github/actions/prebuild-node-profile, the four distribution
# profiles; and every feature in TWO builds, since ioi-node's commitment features are mutually exclusive and
# --all-features does not build: all-hash = every feature whose closure does not enable commitment-kzg, all-kzg =
# every feature whose closure does not enable commitment-hash, each with every ioi-services feature); and the direct
# normal dependencies of ioi-node and ioi-services under default features and under every feature (cargo metadata
